'''Northwind Logging Camp''' is a lumber mill camp located in northwestern [[Northwind]], to the north of the [[Jousting Grounds]]. It has been overrun by members of the [[Defias Brotherhood]], and the surviving lumberjacks have fled to [[Stillheart Port]].

